[32m+[m[32m      Hello! I fear it's been a little while, I have updated my <a href="/now.html">NOW</a> page but aside from that I haven't really been online. I tried to write something for the World Cup but it was more waffle than I could handle to post lol. I have been keeping myself under wraps lately. I had a bit of a clarity moment which has sent me on a path to losing some weight, which is no bad thing. 2 and a half stone so far. I have however been finding it difficult to really start things, I am slowly reading <a href="https://bookwyrm.social/book/1693992/s/automatic-noodle">Automatic Noodle</a> by Annalee Newitz, It's a fun novelette about robots picking up the pieces following a war. It's a good read but I'm just being slow lately. I've been building up my music collection adding Aaron-Lee Tasjan's latest album <a href="https://altobviously.bandcamp.com/album/get-over-it-underdog">Get Over It, Underdog</a> a notable highlight along with <a href="https://theblackdrumset.bandcamp.com/album/friends-in-dark-places"> Friends in Dark Places</a> by The Black Drumset.[m[41m [m
